{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》不乏大膽情節，繼鄺潔楹落「迷姦水」陷害陳自瑤後，今晚（16日）播出一集，鄺潔楹因欠債被逼做援交接客，豈料過程遭楊茜堯派人全程偷拍，令親熱畫面曝光，其中鄺潔楹罕有大尺度演出，在戲中扮演吸毒的她，神情迷離，不時合眼傻笑等，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:55:28.727815+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T08:02:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T08:48:39.303499+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T08:48:39.303499+00:00","content_hash":"e8e7653fe2f80f7f11e59790756fc03edc463e5b7b6e1ad4fb9d5ebfa8d549e8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}